{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1000_se", "source_sha256": "8e7f14ac05b8af6347c8336517efb85357319e29b9542e34b554f154c45397ba", "ja": "コンコン", "zh": "叩叩", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "7e60b7d9a6eb9c5dbfbf1a11b897a2d6542a5676945a8a5e377f7cb126a1644d", "ja": "失礼します。先生、……。", "zh": "打扰了，老师……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9c8367b699f9c7e30fb0b7e63cc17b0e7c6348a47d5b6757b49c1bb9b8e5c5da", "ja": "先生？", "zh": "老师？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "5c99ea478fb4bf38c012d08d8440f9c29b8cc83ca6a8ca6b003e40e3f5c7bb4f", "ja": "間違えました。今のは、忘れてください。", "zh": "我搞错了，请忘掉我刚才说的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "b4eba26d50255d3f847185139a1bce07e7b09ad0e19cb6ef858b6f0c238197a5", "ja": "{$P$}。お仕事の最中、すみません。\n消しゴムが余っていたら、貸してもらえませんか。", "zh": "{$P$}，抱歉在工作中打扰。\n如果你有多的橡皮擦，可以借给我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fe0df6f0115894d96346850e3c81c54daa03a75c2522a3a448f7b6f8c9f9dd42", "ja": "消しゴムか？　えーと、確か引き出しに……。\nあったあった。はい、どうぞ。", "zh": "橡皮擦？呃──我记得抽屉有……\n有了有了。来，拿去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "b8566e2b0bd8c6f41249b8a0fbedeebbcb21c984d0cd657cb7213ff913b419a7", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\n……小さい。年季、いえ、歴史を感じます。", "zh": "非常谢谢你。\n小小的……可以感受到岁月，不，感受到历史。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1007_p", "source_sha256": "bfb92e86407c9d9dd35ec6228b6c57e343724a006a8b4643da583cf53777b3ad", "ja": "歴史なんて言うほど大げさなものじゃないけど、\n確かに、劇場ができる前から使ってるかな……。", "zh": "虽然说不上是历史那么夸张，\n但这的确从剧场落成之前就在用了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "fa5eb4a396d35fae31c324314d8b65acf53a8cff078549a44e0c82f042575eba", "ja": "そうですか。ではやはり、歴史かと。", "zh": "这样啊，那果然该称之为历史。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "2e1bdc8d0067b52d3fff21525a046f25e94a6584bab278a18b4a3d04e17b3a6f", "ja": "私がアイドルになる前から、この消しゴムは、\n765プロライブ劇場を見守ってきたんですね。", "zh": "在我成为偶像之前，这个橡皮擦\n就一直守护着765艺能演唱会剧场呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7716be433a49af2044f56f512d659c3e0dfb9a46d357259f8b8a64607080a309", "ja": "それを言うなら、今の瑞希もかな。乙女ストーム！の\nみんなの勉強を見守ってくれて、ありがとう。", "zh": "要这么说的话，现在的瑞希也一样呢。\n谢谢你一直守护着『少女风暴！』成员的课业。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1011_p", "source_sha256": "47bea0bc5f767715be72c7f5dedb90ac1ea610c3a837a5aa4664db5379ec0cb5", "ja": "ところで、みんなの調子はどうだ？\nちゃんと勉強してるか？", "zh": "对了，大家的状况怎么样？\n有好好念书吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "fe10db1c800963f8a6e42c3bfe4f4ead04ad3a8e6f87953608044bbf610e6d60", "ja": "はい。みんな、思った以上に苦戦していて、\nとても教え甲斐があります。", "zh": "嗯，大家都陷入了预期之外的苦战，\n因此教起来很有成就感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2181f3029f1ef596e061dff51b19d7b5be1b13426b819ac0aab9ec00177aec84", "ja": "そ、そうか……でも、頑張ってるんだな。\n未来や翼が勉強を放り投げないだけでも、凄いことだ。", "zh": "是、是吗……不过大家都很努力呢。\n光是未来和翼没放弃课业，就已经很不得了了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "f445e3fe4816df49af5622a662e238bb656d9b7d9aee17a1e8a093f350ffbacc", "ja": "そうでしたか。\nでは、少しは効果があったのでしょうか。", "zh": "这样啊。\n那么，我算是有多少帮上忙了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b02932c60a9c36eaf006bf5cb982bc3ffe39f378b240c08d83d52c13796686e9", "ja": "もちろん。ありがとう、瑞希。", "zh": "那当然。谢谢你，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "e453676caf740313f8044f043a1b0dd6338dec98bd055f573c5c188501adf354", "ja": "お礼を言われるほどのことではありません。\n……でも、嬉しいな。", "zh": "这点小事用不着道谢。\n不过……我很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "87c40ab30edaf90c923fcf9be88eac2ba52d92c2aaba89274b8cf355a62dbdc2", "ja": "{$P$}。\n私は今、とても不思議な手応えを感じています。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n很不可思议地，我现在感到非常得心应手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "fcd7cacb911cf1525185508758e7ceb45267cad9113b5e08274cbf49f636f7b9", "ja": "具体的に言うと、ドキドキして、ソワソワしています。\n……具体的じゃなかった。", "zh": "说得更具体一点，我感到心跳不已，又跃跃欲试。\n……这样不具体呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b4f4e714bab87839e02cd4dfee81d44e9d469952297d299106a470e60f9fe60c", "ja": "いや、わかるよ。乙女ストーム！のみんなも、\n瑞希を頼りにしてる。これからも、よろしく頼む。", "zh": "不，我明白。『少女风暴！』的成员\n也都很仰赖瑞希。今后也要拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0043_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "ba4b0a07dc3f6bac22b089fa36813ba3933ca42b77c3a5ca4627453c555d50a8", "ja": "はい、お任せください。平均点をキープして、みんなの\n放課後と、笑顔を守ります。……家庭教師、瑞希。", "zh": "是，请交给我。我会维持住平均成绩，守护大家的\n放学时间及笑容……现在我是家庭教师，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
